UnitCLFactoryIndexation::PoolByTokenIndexPaginated
├── when end is lt or eq start
│   └── it reverts with end <= start
└── when end is gt start
    ├── when end is gt array length
    │   └── it reverts with INVALID
    └── when end is leq array length
        └── it returns elements from poolByTokenIndex array from start (inclusive) to end (exclusive)
